1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,135
In nineteen eleven, Kamerlingh Onnes cooled mercury with liquid helium, and found something astonishing.

2
00:00:07,135 --> 00:00:11,445
At four point two kelvin, its resistance suddenly vanished.

3
00:00:11,445 --> 00:00:12,864
Not very small.

4
00:00:12,864 --> 00:00:16,002
Zero, as far as any instrument can tell.

5
00:00:16,002 --> 00:00:19,908
That sharp temperature is the critical temperature, T c.

